T-005 acceptance-first RED evidence (bash) -- deliberately mismatched wrapper
==============================================================================
Mutation: validate-facet-manifest.sh had a stray 'printf "MISMATCHED-WRAPPER-CANARY"' line
inserted before its exec, so its stdout no longer matches the .py master's
(and, transitively, .ps1's) stdout for the same input -- a deliberately
mismatched wrapper, exactly the class of defect TEST-031 exists to catch.
Reverted immediately after this run (diff -q confirmed byte-identical restore).

